language ESSENCE' 1.0

find sudoku: matrix indexed by [int(1..9), int(1..9)] of int(1..9)
such that
allDiff([sudoku[1,1], sudoku[1,2], sudoku[1,3], sudoku[1,4],
sudoku[1,5], sudoku[1,6], sudoku[1,7], sudoku[1,8], sudoku[1,9]])
,

$ Bound this regression so its complete solution set stays small.
(forAll i : int(2..9) . forAll j : int(1..9) . sudoku[i,j]=1),
(forAll j : int(3..9) . sudoku[1,j]=j)
